  "instructions": [
    "in a large mixing bowl, combine the flour, sugar, yeast, and salt.",
    "add the warm water and mix until a dough forms.",
    "knead the dough for 5 minutes until it becomes smooth and elastic.",
    "divide the dough into 8 equal pieces and roll each piece into a ball.",
    "place the balls of dough onto a lightly floured surface and use a rolling pin to flatten each ball into a disk.",
    "heat a tava-griddle or large skillet over medium heat and brush with vegetable oil.",
    "cook the pastry for 2-3 minutes on each side, or until golden brown.",
    "while the pastry is cooking, prepare the red wine jelly by melting it in a saucepan over low heat.",
    "once the pastry is cooked, brush it with the melted red wine jelly and sprinkle with dried thyme and rosemary.",
    "dust the pastry with confectioners' sugar and serve warm"
